[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13260.229, "timestamp": "03:41:00", "text": "私はジョックにこう言った。時々私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13262.55, "timestamp": "03:41:02", "text": "意地悪に思われるかもしれないけど、いや、そんなつもりはない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13265.37, "timestamp": "03:41:05", "text": "である"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13268.389, "timestamp": "03:41:08", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13271.429, "timestamp": "03:41:11", "text": "私は感じます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13276.309, "timestamp": "03:41:16", "text": "ええと、彼らはサスクと両方が好きです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13279.19, "timestamp": "03:41:19", "text": "今ではもっと素晴らしいことがたくさん起こっている。しかしそれは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13280.083, "timestamp": "03:41:20", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "😂 well I mean makes sense afterall"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13281.91, "timestamp": "03:41:21", "text": "感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13284.229, "timestamp": "03:41:24", "text": "なぜなら彼らはインド地域にいるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13287.15, "timestamp": "03:41:27", "text": "インドの"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13289.71, "timestamp": "03:41:29", "text": "経験から言えば、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13291.91, "timestamp": "03:41:31", "text": "外で、私が言ったように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13293.429, "timestamp": "03:41:33", "text": "友人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13295.83, "timestamp": "03:41:35", "text": "もしかしたら私は部外者の立場から話しているのかもしれない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13299.51, "timestamp": "03:41:39", "text": "だから私はもっと知っているような気がするのですが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13301.67, "timestamp": "03:41:41", "text": "中に入ってみれば、彼らがどうしているか分かるかもしれない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13303.349, "timestamp": "03:41:43", "text": "作業中です。よし、これで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13312.99, "timestamp": "03:41:52", "text": "うん。彼らには良いものが必要だと私は思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13315.429, "timestamp": "03:41:55",